["<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n2\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜を除いて</span><span class=\"lvb\">N2</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">除了……之外、不包括……</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">except; excluding; apart from</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + を除いて / 名词 + を除き / 名词 + を除く + 名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + を除いて / Noun + を除き / Noun + を除く + Noun</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>年末年始<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんまつねんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて、<ruby>図書館<rp>(</rp><rt>としょかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">除了新年假期，图书馆每天都开放。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The library is open every day except during the New Year holidays.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>一部<rp>(</rp><rt>いちぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>地域<rp>(</rp><rt>ちいき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き、<ruby>明日<rp>(</rp><rt>あした</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>全国<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>的<rp>(</rp><rt>てき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>晴<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">除部分地区外，明天全国都是晴天。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Except for some areas, it will be sunny nationwide tomorrow.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>件<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っているのは、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>三<rp>(</rp><rt>さん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>にん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかいない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">除了我，只有三个人知道这件事。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Apart from me, only three people know about this.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">比「〜以外」正式。书面也写作「〜を除き」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">More formal than 〜以外. 〜を除き is the written form.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n2.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n2\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をはじめ</span><span class=\"lvb\">N2</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">以……为代表，连同其他同类事物</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">starting with; including; such as (a representative example)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をはじめ / 名词 + をはじめとして / 名词 + をはじめとする + 名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をはじめ / Noun + をはじめとして / Noun + をはじめとする + Noun</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>京都<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には、<ruby>金閣寺<rp>(</rp><rt>きんかくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはじめ、<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くの<ruby>有名<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>寺<rp>(</rp><rt>てら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">京都有许多著名寺庙，金阁寺便是其中之一。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Kyoto has many famous temples, including Kinkakuji.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>社長<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはじめとして、<ruby>社員<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>全員<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がこの<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>賛成<rp>(</rp><rt>さんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">从社长到普通员工，公司上下都赞成这个计划。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Everyone in the company, starting with the president, agreed to this plan.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>米<rp>(</rp><rt>こめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはじめとする<ruby>農産物<rp>(</rp><rt>のうさんぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>価格<rp>(</rp><rt>かかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>上昇<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">包括大米在内的农产品价格正在上涨。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Prices of farm products, rice among them, are rising.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">先点出群体中最有代表性的一项，再指向整个群体。后项涵盖多种事物。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Names the most representative member of a group, then refers to the group as a whole. The main clause covers many items, not just A.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n2.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n2\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をめぐって</span><span class=\"lvb\">N2</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">围绕……，多指有争议的问题</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">over; concerning; surrounding (an issue of dispute)</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をめぐって / 名词 + をめぐる + 名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をめぐって / Noun + をめぐる + Noun</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>空港<rp>(</rp><rt>くうこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>建設<rp>(</rp><rt>けんせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をめぐって、<ruby>住民<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つに<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">居民对修建新机场意见不一。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Residents are divided over the construction of a new airport.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>遺産<rp>(</rp><rt>いさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をめぐって、<ruby>兄弟<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>あいだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもめごとが<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">兄弟姐妹为父亲的遗产发生了争执。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">A dispute broke out between the siblings over their father&#x27;s inheritance.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>首相<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>発言<rp>(</rp><rt>はつげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をめぐる<ruby>議論<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">围绕首相发言的争论仍在继续。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The debate surrounding the prime minister&#x27;s remarks is still going on.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">后项常是「議論する」「対立する」「争う」等，涉及争论、对立或竞争。单纯说明某一话题时，用「〜について」。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">The verb that follows is about debate, conflict or competition (議論する, 対立する, 争う). Unlike 〜について, it isn&#x27;t used for simply explaining a topic.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n2.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>","<details class=\"gd\" data-level=\"n2\"><summary><span class=\"gd-p\" lang=\"ja\">〜をもとに</span><span class=\"lvb\">N2</span><span class=\"gd-m\"><span class=\"t-zh\">以……为依据或素材</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">based on; using ... as a basis or source</span></span></span></summary><div class=\"gd-body\"><p class=\"gp-conn\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">接续</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">名词 + をもとに / 名词 + をもとにして / 名词 + をもとにした + 名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">Noun + をもとに / Noun + をもとにして / Noun + をもとにした + Noun</span></span></p><ul class=\"gp-ex\"><li><span lang=\"ja\">この<ruby>小説<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>作者<rp>(</rp><rt>さくしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>自身<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>体験<rp>(</rp><rt>たいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもとに<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">这部小说以作者自身的经历为素材。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">This novel is based on the author&#x27;s own experiences.</span></span></span></li><li><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたデータをもとにして、グラフを<ruby>作成<rp>(</rp><rt>さくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\"><span class=\"t-zh\">我根据收集到的数据做了一张图表。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">I made a graph based on the data I had collected.</span></span></span></li></ul><p class=\"note\"><b><span class=\"t-zh\">补充</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">補足</span></b><span class=\"t-zh\">前项是创作新事物的材料或线索。「〜に基づいて」则把规则、事实等作为要严格遵循的依据。</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span lang=\"en\">A is the material or hint from which something new is made. 〜に基づいて is used when strictly following a rule or fact as a standard.</span></span></p><p class=\"gd-more\"><a href=\"https://github.com/evanclan/OpenJLPT/blob/main/data/json/grammar/n2.json\"><span class=\"t-zh\">查看 OpenJLPT 来源</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">OpenJLPT の出典を見る</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> →</span></a></p></div></details>"]